cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use FHElium in research or software, please cite the software using
  the metadata in this file.
title: "FHElium: A Cross-Stack CKKS Research Framework for CPU and CUDA"
type: software
abstract: >-
  FHElium is an open-source, cross-stack CKKS research framework with Python
  APIs, a typed PyTorch frontend, and native CPU and CUDA execution. It uses
  dense process-local tensors, typed cryptographic state transitions,
  inspectable program transformation, runtime resource mechanisms, and
  programmer-controlled SPMD communication.
